{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_7_level_main_07-01_end","groupId":"main_7","stageId":"main_07-01","title":"别离之夜","storyCode":"7-2","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-01_end.txt","sourceHash":"0bc40b79d9fd5d19b8c6d758a3bc679997e9e1c009ef404a340685dc2f23250e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"魏彦吾的办公室中，对事态的商讨演变成了争执。\n质问，质疑，责难，失望，坚持，叹息。最终，陈选择了孤军奋战。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"narration","text":"魏彦吾办公室 6:30 p.m."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，魏先生。三十二小时后，核心城将与龙门相撞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"它的城邦识别码没有改换，这意味着切尔诺伯格这座移动城邦的核心部分，仍是乌萨斯领土的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦我们攻击了核心城，就等同于对乌萨斯宣战......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动想以这种方式挟持乌萨斯，无异于异想天开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生的反应稍显平静了些。也许在您看来，乌萨斯几乎是个爱好和平的国家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯的扩张建立在它对财富、疆土与发展的渴望上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"只要有利可图，数十年前的乌萨斯帝国会毫无疑问地策动一场战争，哪怕这场战争的敌人是整片大地也在所不惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，向炎挑起战争？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"数百年来大炎从未对外宣战，但这不意味着大炎缺乏赢取战争的能力。不如说，穷兵黩武的国家并不能理解炎的繁荣究竟从何而来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"两败俱伤的大战过后，大炎自然需要许多时日去调养生息，但有着严重内政问题的乌萨斯却会受到更沉重的打击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯已经不再是过往那只庞然恶物，只有蠢人和疯子才会发动一场损失甚巨、无利可图，且必定失败的战争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生，据我所知，这两种人在任何国家与城邦都不少见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"剔除酝酿灾难的种种因素，既是我的职责之一，也是乌萨斯的帝国议会的职能所在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦帝国议会做出答复，我们就会立刻实施各项措施，停止切尔诺伯格核心城的运作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"之后的外交事端，交给外交官们去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只负责把危机消灭在摇篮里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你很信任对方，哪怕对方是乌萨斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不。我很信任利益。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"接连的战争带来了惨痛的教训，纵使乌萨斯成功自战争中攫取了大量的资源，它却无力对抗接踵而至的内部腐蚀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"它没能消化它征服的居民与土地，任何国家都无法同时承受叛乱的剧痛与民众相互仇视产生的剧毒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的乌萨斯帝国只是具外强中干的腐尸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是魏先生相信乌萨斯会遵循利益的走向，履行与你之间的协定的理由？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我和帝国议会议长间没有任何或口头或成文的协议。我们只是同样还保留着少许理智。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"文月，替我发送消息，我需要第一时间得到两方的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......文月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"这里还有一份消息。只属于你的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生和阿米娅小姐，还有小陈......你们也听一听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"文月？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"好好听完，你会改变看法的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我不同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你再拒绝她们，我们就真的要孤立无援了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“魏长官，接到这条消息意味着你必须立刻采取行动。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么......是我的信使。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“接下来的讯息已经过法术加密。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑厚的男声录音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“魏先生，第三和第四集团军出现了松动。我们没能查到事情的源头。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑厚的男声录音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“我甚至没法推测谁是主谋。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑厚的男声录音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“他们在议会席上窃窃私语，嘲笑着我无力取胜的丑态，我却找不出追究他们责任的证据。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑厚的男声录音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“如果在切尔诺伯格发生了什么，您应该倾力阻止。否则事情将一发不可收拾。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑厚的男声录音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“您仍然有足够的智慧与能力，去将事端消灭在源头处。我们无能为力的事情，只能交给您。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......让我听完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"之后是信使的独白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"他是我的信使。让我听完。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑厚的男声录音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“我没能见到维特议长，他派来与我联络的信使也遭到了不明势力的追杀。幸亏这位信使安然无恙。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑厚的男声录音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“这位信使连夜溜出圣骏堡，有人暗中为他提供了方便，我认为乌萨斯的内部势力正在相互拉锯。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑厚的男声录音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“在这之后的路途中，我多次遭遇袭击，也有许多身份不明的人尝试保护我。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"维特的势力帮助了他们......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑厚的男声录音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“我已经抵达了乌拉尔裂谷，征用了脚下的发报站。之后会发生什么事，我也不清楚。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑厚的男声录音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“真希望回龙门喝点家乡的茶。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"他现在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"生死未卜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"听上去帝国议长正要袖手旁观。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"帝国议会虽然是乌萨斯的中心......但切尔诺伯格现在所处的区域，恰好是乌萨斯的边疆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"边疆一直处于军队和残余旧贵族的势力范围之内。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"军队没有在大叛乱后继续参与类似行动的机会，但感染者有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"所有被严密监视的旧贵族都没法策划切尔诺伯格的灾难，但感染者能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，大多数未经训练的整合运动感染者，并不能与军警和被蒙在鼓里的切尔诺伯格常备防暴武装抗衡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但天灾能。切尔诺伯格没有提前拆分地块，面对天灾的袭击，切尔诺伯格无计可施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动需要提前潜入这座城市来阻止城市武装力量的纠集，军队也可以对他们的潜入视而不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门和我们提前预见了整合运动的动向，近卫局也策划了针对整合运动的全面围剿，但切尔诺伯格......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕到今天为止，切尔诺伯格，或者说乌萨斯和他们的喉舌......一声未发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"谜底揭晓了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"无视这座城市的价值，无视所有居民的死活，乌萨斯把切尔诺伯格拱手送给了整合运动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"而已经被感染的，已经在死亡边缘徘徊太久的感染者，无惧死亡的感染者们，将在天灾后接管这座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"他们根本不需要出手，他们只需要......让道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"他们只需要允许这件事情发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"即使这样，切尔诺伯格遭到天灾侵袭后，只是个缺乏资源的死城......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者自然会涌向龙门！无论整合运动是谁在操纵，这一切简直，简直都水到渠成......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"传令。立刻阻拦监察司，使用武力也无所谓。做好一切开战准备，我要龙门保证能确定无误地瘫痪核心城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"在核心城停下之前，不准有一丝让消息传递出去的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你要主动开战？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"文月，在龙门经历了这么多的你应该清楚。胞弟绝不会允许我主动与乌萨斯开战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......哪怕让我们获得优势的代价是这座龙门城的一切。我必须主动出击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"主动开战意味着开战者将必定受到他国的敌视，也更难与其他国家结交战时盟友关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"先进入宣战状态的国家，很可能会陷入孤立无援的境地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这......最糟糕的是无论真相是什么样，也要战争过后才会有人去查证......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"有些国家也并不在乎真相，只是想要一个借口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，魏先生，我相信和平依然可以依靠和平的外交手段去缔造。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希女士，感谢你的建议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"只是很可惜，我和维特就已经是这两个国家最后的和平手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"无论我们的敌人是帝国第三集团军还是乌萨斯皇帝，就算我们必定能够赢得这场战争，这场战争也终归会发生。已经没有和平的可能了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"如果维特不敢通过官方渠道指责或制止这一系列行为，说明他会因此被群起而攻之，甚至适得其反。他是政客，他必定自私。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"把他逼到这个地步，帝国的官僚结构可能已经处于半瘫痪的状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"两个集团军能要挟整个乌萨斯，却要挟不了不在乌萨斯境内的龙门。龙门理应有紧急应对另一座移动城市的措施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那样的话，现在疏散城市已经来不及了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不停下核心城，龙门将会在冲撞中毁之一旦。之后的领土冲突，同样会孕育无尽的灾难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可想要停止核心城......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦我们发射舰炮或派遣特殊队伍进行斩首，便是向乌萨斯宣战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"原本维特可以遏制住的事态，被切尔诺伯格核心城完全切断了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"一座切断了所有通讯，除了识别码以外毫无交流的孤城，想要怎么解释都可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"如你所说，医生。只有龙门能做些什么，只有我们在面对切尔诺伯格的核心城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生，请三思。开战的后果依然严重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"一场战争没法被轻描淡写地带过，但另一个后果，对于龙门来说，只会更加严重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生。罗德岛......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......陈小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"小陈？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我去解决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你是龙门的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以脱离龙门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陈警司，不要自诩有志之士。这不是你的职责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果龙门需要一个叛徒，我可以来当。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彦吾，我对你和你的城市，你这座金玉其外败絮其中的城市......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"已经厌倦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"在你对贫民区出手的时候，我就已经不属于这座城市了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不要在这个时候与我争辩这种对错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"可是他们做错了什么，你为什么要这么对待他们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......“他们做错了什么？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陈小姐，他们做了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我：整合运动选择潜伏在哪里，又是从哪里潜入了这座城市？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你信任贫民窟的居民，他们是不是同样信任你？这种信任究竟在哪里有所体现？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"除了你的线人和林舸瑞的耳目之外，有任何其他一个贫民区的居民向你们报告了“感染者正在渗透他们的聚居地”之类的事实吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"事情发展得很快！没收到线报并不是谁的过错！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你是否收到哪怕一条民间情报？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"有，或是没有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"一条也没有。一个人也没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"没有人相信你们。他们宁可信任外来的暴力煽动者和感染者，也不相信为他们提供生存条件的鼠王和近卫局高级警司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"他们更可能是遭到了整合运动的胁迫，整合运动的感染者有着大量使用暴力的痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"那他们是否想过，龙门从未对他们使用过暴力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会怪罪他们相互扶持的行为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至认为，如果他们不支持身边的感染者，依然仇视着身边的感染者，那么贫民区会自取灭亡，不必等到今天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，他们可以反对整合运动，他们可以与鼠王的人一同抵御渗透，他们可以向你们寻求帮助——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不信任......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"对。他们不信任你们。即使你为这些人付出了无数的时间和资源，他们却从没有信任过你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我们早该让近卫局进驻贫民区！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"拒绝近卫局进驻贫民区的是他们。数次谋害了我近卫局雇员的是他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"在我和林舸瑞用尽办法，终于消灭了贫民区里的危险罪犯与异国恶徒时，对我们战士的牺牲不屑一顾的，也是他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"是龙门拒绝了他们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"回答我，陈小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"看着我的眼睛，回答我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"问题不出在他们身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陈小姐，那么这里出问题的是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经许多次警告过你，我允许你保留自己的想法和理念......前提是你不能被它影响到你的职责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局的职责是保卫龙门。特别督查组的职责是指导近卫局保卫龙门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你倾力保护的贫民区已经成了龙门的漏洞，更可能成为龙门的败着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"他们中被整合运动利用的感染者，制造了龙门攻防战的幌子，让龙门对切尔诺伯格失去了警戒心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"令我们驱除整合运动的战术规划成了核心城趁虚而入的弱点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"而他们中的非感染者，却对一切袖手旁观。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"如果龙门因此陷落，他们就是元凶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"如果龙门成为了战争的发端，生灵涂炭，血流成河，该是谁来承担责任？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多的灾难，只因为这几块城区......只因为我们没有及时采取措施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你的措施难道就是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"这里出问题的是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"是龙门拒绝了他们吗？不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"是他们拒绝了龙门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想抛弃他们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"短视与漠然毁掉了他们自己。我没有任何理由再去支持这些人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陈。我们都沾染了无数的错误。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"错误是必然的，理所应当的。我们只是该弥补错误，或者暂时地掩盖它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我做不到的，总有人可以去做到。只是现在，我依然有我必须要做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"错误？必须做的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，你刚才说的一切，我都明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者只要在城邦里存在就是一种错误，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......冥顽不灵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陈警司，我与你说过的一切，我都记得。做现在的你该做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彦吾，我该做的，近卫局该做的，就是指出谁是错的，然后解决掉那个错误。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"现在看来，按你的定义，错的只会是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"或者说，我也是那个错误。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我就是感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"小陈？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"已经没必要再瞒下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......三年来，你一直在对别人隐瞒我感染者的身份。现在，既然感染者在这座城市里没有容身之处，那我也不应该有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"胡言乱语！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我和她都是感染者。我不属于这里。我有我该做的事，我也不会再犯下更多错误。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"只有我能阻止她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“别有愧疚，我都清楚。我们是结义兄弟，对吧？兄弟可是......知根知底。”\n义亲相残。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我是感染者，也是龙门的叛徒。只有我是适合做这个的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“我恨你。我也恨她们。明明我该爱你们的，而今我却全都恨。”\n血亲相残。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"既然走到今天这一步，我们就都只能继续走下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“为什么是我？为什么要是我？在这位子上有谁会安稳？为什么要是我去坐？”\n至亲相残。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，你要是走出这间办公室，陈晖洁......你会变成龙门的敌人，你将永远都不能再踏入龙门哪怕一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你我十年来所有的努力......都要白废。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的努力......在你做出那种事的时候就已经浪费了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"龙门城即将陷入火海，一场大战迫在眉睫，你有你的手段，我有我的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唯一的区别是，我不是你这种人。我不会把任何人当成“错误”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不能让这座城市沦陷，却也不会做无谋的突袭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"权位自始至终也只是工具。你如果要用这个工具去修整土地，就要符合它的期望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要嘲笑自己，陈督察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你嘲笑它，就只是嘲笑自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我教育你，是让你去改变它，我一直希望你能去改变这片土地的渴求，不再只是繁荣，不再只是一味地昌盛繁荣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那它改变了吗？它能被改变得了吗？我所努力的一切当真是有意义的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"即使现在不能，它以后也必须能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"由你去让它能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"接待员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等，等等！你们是谁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"接待员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在不能进去......侍卫呢？！侍卫在哪里！有人闯入！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公，我们去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"——出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"请让我们去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你不该来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，呵呵，呵呵哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彦吾，你的真面目就这么被轻松揭开了吗？你的私兵就这么大喇喇地出现在你的办公室里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"陈家小姐，龙门有难！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这话听起来很有责任感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但你们说的话，我一句都不会信。你们有什么要和他说的，请便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公......我们可自削面目，轻装入城，袭杀主谋，力阻撞击！事成之后，我们必以身殉城，不使魏公烦忧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了魏彦吾？让我去或者让他们去，很难吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么在杀人的时候雷厉风行，在该救人的时候就变得优柔寡断了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这次......是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"上次，也是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我没指望能好好道别一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，魏彦吾。虽然我想过很多次了，但我也没指望能好好向谁道别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"文月小姐，我妈妈以前对你那样，我很过意不去。谢谢你，谢谢这么多年来对我的照顾。我一直把你当亲人看待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......小陈？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陈警司！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不再是了。这个近卫局的徽章，还给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"——拿下她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"要在这里先厮杀一场？要决定谁才是真正的叛徒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"陈警司，大敌当前！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"作为感染者，我天生就是你们的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"收手吧！否则，不可怪我下手无情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你们对谁手下留情过？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不要用这种冠冕堂皇的口气说你们根本就不可能去做的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公，当心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"赤霄，振气！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“彦吾兄弟，如果这剑是用来屠龙的话，德拉克算不算？”\n“也算？那我是不是该小心点了，哈哈......”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然是......法术乱流？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"医生，快退后，我来挡下法术！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不......能量的结层只会被那种切割性的法术撕碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"她没有瞄准你我，现在，立即退出可能被她法术波及的范围。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"法术开始伸展了。后退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——出！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"斩龙剑，出鞘了一瞬？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"呲......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"用手臂就挡下了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"相当锐利！警司，你的剑术相较从前，确有进境！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......火锻源石。赤霄吗？他们竟然还在铸造这种武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这把剑，医生，难道是专门铸造来对抗能量法术的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......最初陈长官不让我看那把剑，也是设想了与我为敌的情况吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"让开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公，警司确实笃定了心思。我可能没法挡下第二击。需要我搏命吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"我死，定可把陈督察留在龙门，虽不能保她四肢健全，但一定能留她生路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"——不可。你，撤步。不可直撄其锋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"我立刻联系其他弟兄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"想叫后援？赤霄——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"停手！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"晖洁，你想使云裂之剑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"别忘了，你的剑术和你的法术是谁教你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我从来不曾想过要废掉你的剑术，但我不会在此时此刻假意仁慈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"莫要逼我，陈晖洁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你尽管动手好了，魏大人。赤霄在我手里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"给我赤霄的这一天，你是不是觉得我会杀你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会用它来杀你，魏彦吾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得你在保护我，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈是忧郁而死的。塔露拉是被掳走的。我是因为职位染上矿石病的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得你做的这一切都在保护我，是吗？是因为你的愧疚，还是因为你对自己权谋的自信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想任何悲剧再发生在我面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"扯谎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彦吾，这把剑有该杀的人......也有该守住的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她真的想毁掉这座龙门城......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不。你不能去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我从没想过要在这里战胜你和黑蓑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是，魏彦吾，出口可不是只有门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"窗户？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陈晖洁，别做傻事，这里离地面有数百米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这也不是我第一第二次走窗户了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陈晖洁，你绝不能见她！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......小陈......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能重蹈覆辙！你不该走上我们的老路！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"如果一定还要有一个人为这座城市而死，那个人只可以是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......舅舅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不......魏彦吾。今天起，我们恩怨两消。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"玻璃破碎的声音响起，陈仰面坠下了高楼。\n龙门城主高声咆哮，披着黑色雨披的人利箭般跃向了破窗。\n可陈已经下定决心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","aliases":["魏彦吾"]},{"speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","aliases":["文月"]}]}
